id=maxregner_aero
name=Maxregner Aero
version=v39
author=maxregner
description=Real firmware-injected motion engine: adds Lio/mesalabs/unica/MaxregnerAero; to framework.jar with the Maxregner easing curve family (easeStandard cubic, easeEmphasized, easeOvershoot spring), a smoothstep gate, and a seeded value-noise generator for ambient motion that the window/transition animators route through. Compiled into the firmware by apktool.
